@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>“I’ll make my own shoes!“</p>
            <p>
                Christian Bär suffered from sore feet: Long hours of walking or standing were a real problem. No matter how many different kinds of shoes he tried, the result was always the same. The shoes may have looked good, but they simply weren‘t comfortable.
            </p>
            <p>
                “I can’t be the only one with this problem,” he thought, and came up with a revolutionary solution: “I’ll design my own shoes!”
                Christian studied the secrets of making high quality, handmade shoes and in 1982 he and his wife Hilke founded BÄR GmbH in the picturesque southern German town of Bietigheim-Bissingen.
            </p>
            <p>
                The shoe industry was unimpressed: Form fitting shoes? Who needs them? Nobody believed the idea would be successful. But Christian Bär didn’t let a lack of potential distributors discourage him: “We‘ll sell the shoes ourselves.”
            </p>
            <p>
                Over the years, BÄR has become a model company that has changed with the times and continued to grow. Handmade BÄR comfort shoes are worn by people
            </p>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <img src="~/images/images/about/company.jpg" alt="Company Image" class="img-fluid rounded">
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container mt-5">
    <h2>Our Team</h2>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card">
                <img src="~/images/images/about/ManagingDirector.jpg" style="height: 350px;" alt="Managing Director" class="card-img-top">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title ">Christof Bär</h5>
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">Managing Director</h6>
                    <p class="card-text"> “Bär” alone will not change the world, but it will do something to improve it everyday</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card">
                <img src="~/images/images/about/TeamMembers1.jpg" style="height: 350px;" alt="Team Member 1" class="card-img-top">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Ruchies Antony</h5>
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">Indian Director</h6>
                    <p class="card-text">A director with a background in mechanical engineering who ventures into the shoe manufacturing industry brings a unique blend of technical expertise and innovation to the sector. Their proficiency in mechanical engineering can have a transformative impact on the industry in several ways.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Product Innovation</li>
                        <li>Cost Management</li>
                        <li>Data-Driven Decision Making</li>
                        <li>Manufacturing Efficiency</li>
                        <li>Material Selection</li>
                        <li>Supply Chain Optimization</li>
                        <li>Quality Assurance</li>
                        <li>Sustainability</li>
                        <li>Market Expansion</li>
                        <li>Collaboration</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card">
                <img src="~/images/images/about/TeamMembers2.jpg" style="height: 350px;" alt="Team Member 2" class="card-img-top">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Imanuel Talayman</h5>
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">Indian Director</h6>
                    <p class="card-text">A director with a profession with IT analytics and finance, taking the helm of a shoe manufacturing company, brings a unique and multidisciplinary skill set to the industry.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Technology Integration</li>
                        <li>Cost Management</li>
                        <li>Financial Strategy</li>
                        <li>Head of Controlling</li>
                        <li>Data Transformation</li>
                        <li>Business Intelligence</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
